WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.440
Senior, we've detected an unknown.

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:03.940
Location: Inner ADIZ.

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:06.740
Roger. Checking data for matching flight.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.910
No matching flight data found.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.240
Glory 01! Scramble!

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.580
This is after we've gotten a little smarter.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:18.580
This is a story about losing track of a lot of things.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.000
I think we already said that.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.710
Looking back now...

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:25.760
At the time, was there a moment when 
we thought the world had changed?

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.720
Nope. It was the same as usual.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.720
We woke up in the morning.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:29.840
Slept at night.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:30.760
Woke up during the night.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:31.660
Slept in the morning.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:32.880
Just as normal...

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:33.510
We worked.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:34.940
Went to school.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:35.570
We were born.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:36.200
And died.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:36.770
We played.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:37.690
And thought.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:38.340
We smiled.

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:38.850
We smiled...

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:39.340
We smiled!

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.020
We smiled...

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.990
We flowed through time.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:43.160
Once you let go...

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.190
You begin to flow.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.280
Before you know it...

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:47.280
You end up on a beach you don't recognize.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.280
Yeah, but I saw something strange!

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.280
Saw what?

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.400
I saw a cracked vase return to normal.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.660
Withered flowers blossom again.

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.120
Flower petals flowing up against the tide.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.290
They must have probably been...

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:00.920
It was you!?

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.460
No, that was me.

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:03.950
It wasn't there until now...

