00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:56.410
Is that it?

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.800
A red cloud!

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:02.360
This is the Nigashio City Council.

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:06.920
We have just confirmed that a pack
of Rodan are flying towards this direction.

00:03:07.710 --> 00:03:09.340
This is a major threat.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:12.590
Please take shelter indoors as soon as possible.

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:15.210
This is the Nigashio City Council.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.720
Please evacuate from the beach and take shelter!

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:17.800
I repeat, evacuate!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.470
A molecule no one could even fathom...

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:24.440
Molecules like benzene, fullerene, 
or rotaxane, for example?

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:28.910
I could not confirm molecules with similar 
structures within any chemical database.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:32.320
Could a molecule like that really exist?

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:36.510
According to simulations, it should be able to stably exist.

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:36.870
I hope our house is fine...

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.320
We should call just in case.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:42.330
Mr. Yamamoto! What are you thinking?

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.530
Hurry back inside. It's dangerous.

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:47.250
Is that so?

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:57.220
There is currently a pack of Rodan within Bousou...

00:03:57.220 --> 00:04:02.140
The Japan Coast Guard has just now prohibited all entry via the surrounding waters.

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:06.270
Are they coming to Nigashio? They're in the ten-thousands!

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:04.530
Their pack appears to be massive.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:09.150
Warnings have been issued 
regarding the flight paths of the Rodan.

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:11.330
Their screeches seem quieter...

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:14.190
Their form, too, seems to have changed somewhat...

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:16.650
That aside, what can we even do about this!?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.780
The government is expected to exterminate them.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:21.280
But what hope do we have against a pack this big?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.140
They might be bound for radio waves,
with them being radio wave Kaiju.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:27.790
Does that mean they are headed for urban areas?

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:33.500
It is also possible that they are attracted to 
electromagnetic waves generated by human activity.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.680
The size of the invading Rodan pack is only growing bigger.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.680
They are extremely fierce and dangerous.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:46.310
Seems Gramps' hunch was on point,
 but who expected a whole pack of 'em?

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:48.430
What exactly are they aiming for?

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.480
We can see fires spreading throughout parts of the city.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:53.940
<b>Breaking</b>

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:53.940
<b>News</b>

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:53.940
<b>A hoard of Rodan have invaded and caused damage to the city</b>

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:53.940
