00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:02.860
Alright!

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.950
We'll lure all the ones in town outta here, just like this!

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:08.450
Is it really gonna be that easy?

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.830
This is bad! They're in front of us, too!

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:16.290
Hit the gas before we get sandwiched!

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:24.260
Oh no!

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.350
Do not go outside under any circumstances.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:42.480
Call out to those who are around you 
and evacuate to a safe place.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.770
Wasn't that my apartment just now!?

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.480
Ugh! I went out with my laundry still hung outside!

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:43.780
Should I go back?

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.320
The next station we're stopping at is...

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:47.360
Darn it, this is an express train!

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.370
Are there any video sources 
where I can see my apartment?

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:55.290
Of the 206 fixed-point cameras I can access,
these three seem to capture your apartment.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.370
This is anything but useful...

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:58.920
I just found something good!

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:03.880
Yun! Get yourself together!

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:06.590
Yun! Are you alright!?

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:08.380
Hey!

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:09.930
Yun!

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:10.800
Oh, shoot!

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.180
Gramps...

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:23.560
There!

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.400
There's Gramps! And he's with someone.

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.510
She's my friend.

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:54.260
She couldn't run away in time.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.770
The bus driver is still in there, too.

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:59.060
Three people inside the bus, then...

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:11.660
This ain't good. There's even more of them.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:29.670
Wow! Woah!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.280
Looking smooth!

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.680
It's that robot from the other day!

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.670
Does that mean this is Habel's company?

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:40.390
I accessed the camera that I can move.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.340
Let's go take a look at your apartment.

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:45.440
Analyzing the operation manual. 
Please wait one moment.

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:48.190
Oh! Here goes. It moves. It moves!

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:50.110
Left, clear. Right, all green.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:53.030
Alright... let's go!

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.200
Habby?

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:55.620
Or is that you, Yung?

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:57.280
Woah—what is it?

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.160
Are you taking him with you?

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.180
Ah—

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:02.040
No, well. It's, um...

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:05.040
Wait a sec. The shutter is locked right now.

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:08.570
O-Okay. Sorry for the hassle.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:15.470
Take care!

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:17.510
Thank you very much!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:19.310
I'll borrow this for a bit.

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:25.600
Borrow?

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:28.440
Is this really okay?

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.780
We're fortunate that person was so kind.

