00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.730
An independent self-employed journalist?

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:01.890
You can call me Kai.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.890
Look, I don't have any money.

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:09.250
You saw my paper and assumed I was someone you could take advantage and make fun of—

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:14.260
I'm Professor Li's substitute. 
She entrusted me with this to hand over to you.

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:17.410
A flower?

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:19.580
Is this some kind of test?

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:22.040
It's nothing theatrical like that, unfortunately.

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:25.960
You're an interesting one. What's your major?

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:27.800
Biologica Fantastica.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:33.300
Is that a field that explores theoretical creatures made up of theoretical matter?

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:37.800
A bug born from its offspring, 
or a bug that produces food from eating its own poop.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:38.810
Poop?

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:43.060
How many eyes do creatures 
living in four-dimensional space need?

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:45.480
Are two-dimensional creatures able to fly?

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:50.820
How about us? We only have two eyes, but have 
you considered how we could see things if we had three?

00:18:50.820 --> 00:18:53.530
How about Rodan? Is it an impossible creature?

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:57.520
It's a possible creature. It exists in our reality, after all.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:58.830
An invitation?

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:04.330
The Professor is currently involved in a 
certain project and so is staying in Dubai.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:07.420
Temporary Short Term Researcher Invitation?

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:09.880
There's something she wants to discuss, it seems.

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:11.840
We will cover your hotel and travel expenses.

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:13.220
Co-research?

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:16.010
An invitation for it, yes.

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:18.470
Can I go? For real?

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:22.970
You're saying our friend here 
gained consciousness and helped us?

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:25.600
I'd welcome a merry story like that with open arms.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:26.980
Thanks as always!

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:30.320
Two Ro-don bowls and one sandwich set.

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:32.730
Thanks! How's the owner doing?

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:33.990
I said so, didn't I?

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:37.330
A new menu. I was correct about 
the lunch you'd have in 2 weeks.

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:39.240
Did you say something like that?

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:42.910
Everything that happens in the future is predetermined.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.970
It's simply that the truth is 
hidden and cannot be known.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:47.870
What's wrong?

