00:22:06.550 --> 00:22:12.300
<b>I woke up to your voice that painted my vision with color</b>

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:18.180
<b>And it was the same shade of curiosity I find in my familiar daily life</b>

00:22:18.180 --> 00:22:23.560
<b>If this feeling can grow naturally on its own</b>

00:22:23.560 --> 00:22:29.440
<b>Will it fall off one day like an unripe fruit, I wonder? </b>

00:22:30.110 --> 00:22:34.070
<b>I don't know anything</b>

00:22:34.070 --> 00:22:38.450
<b>Not even anything about you</b>

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:46.960
<b>Let me keep on dreaming for now</b>

00:22:46.960 --> 00:22:51.340
<b>If this moment is all I have now</b>

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:55.800
<b>I can still feel the warmth in my palm</b>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:03.060
<b>My thrumming feelings open and burst out</b>

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:07.070
<b>I want to keep learning more, like I am now</b>

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:13.610
<b>This pulsating rhythm I feel just won't stop</b>

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:14.570
<b>It won't stop</b>
